      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, right margin",
          "value": "<p>my best regards. And Peace. And to my brother, his children {alt. tr.: sons} and [his] wife special greetings. Likewise, to my sister, her husband Marwa\u0304n, her sons and her daughter, special greetings. And to the daughters of my paternal uncle, their sons and their daughters greetings. To my maternal aunt and her ch[ildren] {alt. tr.: so[ns]} greetings. Greetings to you and to your household!</p>",
